{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的重点词能串出想靠近、怕成为负担、被接纳后放松、想留住却舍不得的具体变化；Y 的大块多是“满足、保证、不确定”等概括，S01 尤其没有把人物的迟疑放进主线。small：X 的非重点文字能补出人物关系中的因果和指代，紧贴重点；Y 的小感受虽然丰富，但部分意象比较游离，S14“整理好衣服，关上了门”还容易让人误读为关系结束。core、concise、human：X 把亲密的幸福和预先到来的失去感放在同一条具体的关系变化里；虽然篇幅较长，但反复出现的担心大多有新的情境推进，Y 则多屏反复围绕“未来、保证、不确定”打转，而且“认出自己那么想要确定答案”“把未来是否确定当作……条件”等表达有明显的摘要腔。fine：Y 的感受文字更集中于身体和心理体验，X 的感受部分经常混入左手、右手、歌声、颤音等音乐描述，冲淡了观众自身体验的比例。load：Y 的话块字号统一、数量较少、意群完整；X 每屏重点词较多，又夹在整句中大小字交错，扫读时需要更多视觉筛选。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a49bbeca-d638-42cd-a3be-b884dab61a72", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T145748400320Z", "elapsed_seconds": 285.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:02:33.857052+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d54fe281efda622c19b75d093f76a2f5f29c4f5f5d07adcf3b1ea90e34d29912", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chat